  "title": "我和他的日常.橘母去兰州了",
  "summary": "丨橘母去兰州了丨 今日，橘母终于踏上了去兰州的旅途。橘子跟她讲，就随身带个小包，拎着常吃的药就行了。其他衣服鞋子等等行李，我们给她寄到兰州去。 好说歹说，寄走了两大箱衣服。但其他东西橘母一定要自己背着拎着。于是乎，我们送她去车站与橘子大姐碰头时，橘子拎着十几二十斤沉甸甸的衣服，我拎着一包沉重的杂物，橘母拎着她的夏季被子。这被子橘母说要带回湖南去，下午，二姐夫的弟弟要送杀好的鸡过来与他们碰头，橘母讲让这弟弟帮忙在今后的某个时光，将这床被子带回湖南去。二姐夫弟弟今年也在重庆打工呢。 然后，他们交接了鸡，但二姐夫弟弟走时忘了带被子。大姐又手忙脚乱将被子发同城快递给二姐夫弟弟。 这床被子的市场价值只有三十来块钱， 但为了完成空间转移，整个家庭物流系统付出了繁杂的成本。 陈旧的被子经过一番神奇的操作，变成了吞资源项目。…",
  "content": "<h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨橘母去兰州了丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日，橘母终于踏上了去兰州的旅途。橘子跟她讲，就随身带个小包，拎着常吃的药就行了。其他衣服鞋子等等行李，我们给她寄到兰州去。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>好说歹说，寄走了两大箱衣服。但其他东西橘母一定要自己背着拎着。于是乎，我们送她去车站与橘子大姐碰头时，橘子拎着十几二十斤沉甸甸的衣服，我拎着一包沉重的杂物，橘母拎着她的夏季被子。这被子橘母说要带回湖南去，下午，二姐夫的弟弟要送杀好的鸡过来与他们碰头，橘母讲让这弟弟帮忙在今后的某个时光，将这床被子带回湖南去。二姐夫弟弟今年也在重庆打工呢。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>然后，他们交接了鸡，但二姐夫弟弟走时忘了带被子。大姐又手忙脚乱将被子发同城快递给二姐夫弟弟。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这床被子的市场价值只有三十来块钱，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>但为了完成空间转移，整个家庭物流系统付出了繁杂的成本。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>陈旧的被子经过一番神奇的操作，变成了吞资源项目。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>被子就这样被负重前行一路，油费和邮费（人力成本还没有算）已经超过了陈旧被子的价值，它成为了一块豆腐被盘成肉价钱的被子。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>假如一开始就把被子寄走，整个流程简单得令人乏味，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>打包、发货、结束。我们因为做电商和快递还有低于市场价格的协议价。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子：你们折腾啥呢？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>到最后还不是寄走，搬着被子一路负重前行的意义何在？ ？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们和大姐以及橘母告别后，橘子拎着一袋大姐从兰州带来的囊走向停车场。出租车司机在旁边喊：“你们去哪里？走不走走不走？”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子说是车子停在这里的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>出租车司机在旁边喊：“你们出去玩就买了一大包囊回来呀？为啥要在外面买呀？这边不是有囊卖吗？外面的囊好吃些吗？”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子一本正经地瞎说，味道真的不一样。 （他其实不喜欢吃这个）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>回到终于清净的家里，我们长出一口气，整个气场都变得轻盈起来。哪怕是我们俩还有修水管的工作没有完成，精神上也轻松了许多。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子给遗留在房间里的台灯换灯泡，我说：这台灯她竟然没有带走？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子嘿嘿笑，说：你不要说得这么嘲讽嘛~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>接下来我又要继续画各种精怪了，橘子也要接着做他的古琴了。在我们进行这些活动时，身边终于没有一个人紧紧贴着你站着，并指手画脚指导你了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>真好哇！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨亲戚丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>之前我的表姐孙梦霞50多岁高龄做试管婴儿生了个儿。跟她一起来的还有个我们的亲戚表姐英霞。我一直以为英霞也姓孙，是老妈母系那边的亲戚。我的外公姓钱，外婆姓孙。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>老妈说：英霞她不姓孙！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我大吃一惊：那她姓啥？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我老妈思考良久：......不知道啊！ （英霞当我们这么多年亲戚，结果我们根本不知道她姓啥，我们是不是太水了？）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我妈想了很久，不确定地说：英霞的妈可能是我姑姑？是河南那边的人！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我问：那她姓啥啊？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我妈：反正不姓钱，她跟她爹姓噻！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨管子工丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们租的农民房，水表入户的水管爆了几天了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>当初水利公司来接水管时，他们的水管偏细是25的，我们这个屋子的主进水管是32的，施工方不管三七二十一，将细管的头热熔了一下直接怼进了粗管子里。就这施工质量，也别吹什么基建狂魔了，应该改称基建草台班子。这次水管爆就是从这个胡乱怼的地方爆的，一股嘶嘶作响的水流不分昼夜在这里喷射出来持续流淌。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子翻遍家里的水管接头，发现没有32转25的接头，于是临时去网上采买，等待了两三日，接头终于抵达。于是橘子和我两个管子工再度上线了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>农村的水表离屋子几百米远，我们拎着沉重的线盘和接水管工具，去附近的住户家借电。有了电之后，橘子和我很快开始作业，橘子先用管子钳剪断管子，将漏水的水管段截断扔掉。我手持加热到260度的热熔器，将它探到橘子需要操作的位置（农村的水管位置都比较奇葩，比如这次的水管是从山坡和石坎之间穿过的，橘子站在只容一人站立的坎下，我站在坎上），他指挥我调整热熔器的方向垂直于管道，随后将管子和转接头一一怼进热熔器里加热，管子热熔好以后，他将它拔出，他捏紧热熔器另一侧加热好的转接头叫我迅速把热熔器从接头处拔出来，随后，他将转接头和水管怼在一起。就这样，我们配合着熔接好水管接头。我跑去打开水表总阀，橘子留在原地观察自己的熔接成果，很棒，没有漏水，供水系统恢复了完美。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子的大姐打电话说：“你们叫人上门修水管就行了啊，自己这么麻烦干啥？”橘子解释说我们居住在山顶，绝大多数修理师傅不愿意上山，而且水利公司只管水表前的问题，表后的问题他们概不负责。大姐嘟嘟囔囔着麻烦，住这么远，条件差。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>嘿，这是我们的选择，这是我们转化的场所。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>回到家后，橘子马不停蹄冲去开洗衣机洗衣服去了，我则奔赴厨房开始做饭。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们的小世界又开始自成圆满地运转起来。一切恢复如常。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨猫胃口大增丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘母走了以后，猫也很高兴。因为猫在吃饭时，橘母总是像看稀奇一样凑过来很近地贴着猫，近身看她吃饭。猫一开始很生气，她扭头就走不吃饭了。后面猫觉得不划算，饭还是要吃的。她忍着被贴身的不适，迅速吃饭。再后来，猫开始视橘母为空气，老子吃老子的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>如今橘母走了，猫发现没有人贴着她观察她吃饭了，她变得很积极地吃饭，上午来回叫我去开猫条，下午来回叫我去开猫条，晚上来回叫我去开猫条。她简直像个饭桶。唉，不能吃那么多猫条啊，妈妈我钱包支撑不了啊~~~~~~~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
